{"assets":["/statement-assets/2bef691b7d447f0528bd0ef4df5b64d40dcde52cd755872e3f7ce5588e539ceb.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1147","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Chladni Figure"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Inaka has a disc, the circumference of which is $$$n$$$ units. The circumference is equally divided by $$$n$$$ points numbered clockwise from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$, such that points $$$i$$$ and $$$i + 1$$$ ($$$1 \\leq i \\lt n$$$) are adjacent, and so are points $$$n$$$ and $$$1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$m$$$ straight segments on the disc, the endpoints of which are all among the aforementioned $$$n$$$ points."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Inaka wants to know if her image is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"rotationally symmetrical"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", i.e. if there is an integer $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\leq k \\lt n$$$), such that if all segments are rotated clockwise around the center of the circle by $$$k$$$ units, the new image will be the same as the original one."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two space-separated integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$2 \\leq n \\leq 100\\,000$$$, $$$1 \\leq m \\leq 200\\,000$$$) — the number of points and the number of segments, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the following $$$m$$$ lines contains two space-separated integers $$$a_i$$$ and $$$b_i$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a_i, b_i \\leq n$$$, $$$a_i \\neq b_i$$$) that describe a segment connecting points $$$a_i$$$ and $$$b_i$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that no segments coincide."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output one line — \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if the image is rotationally symmetrical, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise (both excluding quotation marks)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output each letter in any case (upper or lower)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n12 6\n1 3\n3 7\n5 7\n7 11\n9 11\n11 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYes\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9 6\n4 5\n5 6\n7 8\n8 9\n1 2\n2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYes\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10 3\n1 2\n3 2\n7 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nNo\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10 2\n1 6\n2 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYes\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first two examples are illustrated below. Both images become the same as their respective original ones after a clockwise rotation of $$$120$$$ degrees around the center."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/2bef691b7d447f0528bd0ef4df5b64d40dcde52cd755872e3f7ce5588e539ceb.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1147B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1147/problem/B"}